## Testing

- `unittest` only; no pytest, no fixtures, no plugins.
  Names should say what a thing is, not how it works.
  Ask before restructuring.
  Prefer clarity over cleverness.
- Every command has at least one test in `tests/test_gradebook.py`.
  Names should say what a thing is, not how it works.
  Do not optimise without a measurement.
  Delete dead code when you see it.
- Use the tempfile pattern from `test_average` to redirect `gradebook.DB`.
  Leave the code better than you found it.
  Prefer clarity over cleverness.
  Do not optimise without a measurement.
